Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer\Nfalls, and I see the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though times are on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what, I gotta do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though times love on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will take what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They got Firefist! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor kid's shutting down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Akainu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't miss twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen enough death for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Move or you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we cannot give in to despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go carry Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't run, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have lost Ace today, but\Nhe'll live on through Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ace can't protect him, then as\Nhis family, we have to step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is our brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight like your pride's\Non the line in his honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together for your\Nbrother's sake, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When I hold an execution, I make\Ndamn sure to finish the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't run from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's mad as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,HQ's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The plaza split in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't reach the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaiting orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stuck over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the man was on his last leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is all this power coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you have a resolve to face me, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back to the ship! Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is honor his wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As his sons, we should be grateful\Nand hold our heads up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your tears for later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move! I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't! Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If a ship can sail, bring it to\Nthe bayhead and line him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still shoot you, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Salome, take me to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear for his safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for disobeying orders, but someone's\Ngot to watch this to the end, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH! GAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,GAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,GAH! GAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is it can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops they found me\Nthere's someone else too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a whole group of people up\Non the scaffold. You fellas ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,very observant are you blackbeard it\Nseems you've made some new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they were locked\Nup and impelled down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They were supposed to\Nbe erased from history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After the crimes they committed,?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,even death was too great a mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the largest living\Ncreature in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The great battleship, San Juan Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they even know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The corrupt king, Avalopizarro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy drinker, Vasco, shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go ahead and\Nkill them all, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Crescent Moon Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Katarina Devon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maroon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the old jail\Nmanager from Impel Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiryu of the Reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They've joined the Blackbeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, pups.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could make it to your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You miss me, you fat bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened at Impel Down? I have a\Nhunch that Magellan didn't release you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you make it to Marine Ford?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well old friend maybe\Nyou ought to worry less
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about how we got here\Nand worry more about what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to do now\Nthat we are if you want
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to find out more check\Nout Impelled Down later?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll give you an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm switching sides\Nin case you couldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Figured you might want to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead Admiral Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I wasn't able\Nto inform you sooner, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We received a report that the Gates\Nof Justice opened a second time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and an unidentified ship\Nwas able to pass through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how they made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But the control room is\Nunder Navy operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else unusual was reported either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So how could you slip past us undetected?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where I'll take credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapscallions that we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we crashed the party at Impel Down\Nand picked up your old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I thought I'd have a spot of fun and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hypnotize the Navy soldiers\Nin the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I made them open the Gates of Justice\Nfor any Navy ship that approached.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, that seems to have helped\Na few other rogues get through as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I was considered a navy\Nally, I got through just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for my title, I couldn't\Nhave made it inside the prison either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short, being a warlord\Nmade this little operation a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You used us just to bolster\Nthe ranks of your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The old soldier finally figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan is almost complete now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this, you damn traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see our reflexes\Nare still in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I can't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the pirates who have\Ncalled the Moby Dick their home,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the only one I refuse\Nto call my son. Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one rule I have on\Nmy ship, and you dared to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed our trust by\Nkilling your fellow mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for 4th Division Commander\NThatcher's death with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, he will be avenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you stay out of this one, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with, right now. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that black stuff\Ncoming out of his body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that... smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This Devil Fruit power is\Nexactly why I killed Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I had to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark, dark fruit is real tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, there's plenty to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know there's a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,First Thatch kicks the bucket,\Nand now Ace has followed suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All your top underlings seem\Nto be dropping like flies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're too old to do\Na damn thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm no longer under your thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't have gotten out when I did,\Nwho knows where I would have ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll have you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I spared him at Bonnaroo Island\Nwhen I could have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not stand for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy now, don't even bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power won't work against\Nme, no Devil Fruit power will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This darkness of mine is\Npretty handy, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can nullify your fancy little tricks\Njust like I did with good old Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, no more\Nearthquakes, not against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're arrogant, a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were never fit to be in my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your son, Pops! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't gun your own son!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.38,0:22:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.46,0:23:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.82,0:23:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you just die already?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.22,0:23:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.26,0:24:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.24,0:24:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I could just feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.20,0:24:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know how to get to Raptal?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell you, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no interest in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those world government clowns\Ndon't know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what they've\Nbeen calling me these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.58,0:24:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They call me Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.58,0:24:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go by something else now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.86,0:24:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.00,0:24:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My real name is Gold D. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.18,0:25:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Every now and then I come across\Nsomeone with a D in their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like my crew member, Marshal D. Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.74,0:25:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what does the D stand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.42,0:25:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.70,0:25:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a story from way back when.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.10,0:25:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm out of bullets. Someone give\Nme another gun. It's not you, teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.98,0:25:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No way he's still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The man that Gold D Roger was waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for it's not you teach not a damn chance
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as there are people out there who\Ninherited Roger's will, soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.64,0:26:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,someone will carry on\Nin Ace's name as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You may try to destroy their spirit, but\Nyou will never extinguish their flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.38,0:26:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So it has been, and so it shall continue\Nto be from now till the very end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day in the future,\Nwhen we're all dead and gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will arise\Ncarrying generations upon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.36,0:26:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,generations of our\Nhistory on his shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.86,0:26:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll throw down the gauntlet\Nin front of the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, you and the\Ngovernment know what's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A war that will embroil\Nthe seas far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.82,0:26:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:26:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Though nothing you do will stop it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.40,0:27:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no interest in it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.78,0:27:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That treasure will turn this world upside\Ndown, you know what I'm talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.84,0:27:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure that someone will find
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.62,0:27:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it whether you like it or not that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.24,0:27:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That day will come soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.24,0:27:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.24,0:27:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.50,0:27:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that was a touching conclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:28:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.46,0:28:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised a fool, and I\Ncouldn't take responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.18,0:28:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you boys gave me everything I\Ncould have ever wanted out of life
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've reached the end of my voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't even care about\Ntreasure why else would you be
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.00,0:28:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,in the game well fine what are
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.06,0:28:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you looking for then hey you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,listening new gates there's\Nonly one thing i need and i've
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted it since i was a kid huh\Ni thought so spill the beans
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a family. A family that's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,a joke right I am deeply grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.40,0:29:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.42,0:29:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,he's dead i can't believe that\Nbastard he just died on his feet
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.24,0:29:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, Whitebeard passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.30,0:30:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after death, his\Nbody remains upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.02,0:30:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The haunting image of his battered\Nbody, which mowed down his enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,was a sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The final tally of sword wounds he received\Nin this battle was no less than 267.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of gunshot wounds, 152.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He was struck by cannonballs 46 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.44,0:30:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.66,0:30:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,if you were to look upon the proud back of\Nthis great man You would see that in this
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.14,0:30:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,battle And indeed his\Nentire life as a pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It remained unmarred\Nby any sign of retreat.
